{
  "file_id": "3622",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 101,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We're here! The spatial control\ncore should be in the back!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13768,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "¡Ya llegamos! ¡El núcleo de\ncontrol espacial debe de estar\nal fondo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Tai! Over there!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13828,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Mira allí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Daisuke! Takato!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13848,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Daisuke! ¡Takato!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Takuya! And Masaru!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13865,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Takuya! ¡Y Masaru!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Taiki and Tagiru!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13885,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Taiki y Tagiru!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Glad we're all together now!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13903,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Qué bien, ya estamos todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "We heard everything about you and\nGankuumon!",
      "speaker_id": 7011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13932,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡Nos contaron todo sobre\nti y Gankoomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "So that's why we're all here!",
      "speaker_id": 7021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13977,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Por eso estamos todos aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Well, a lot of stuff happened, but\nnow's not the time to be talking\nabout that.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14007,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Bueno, pasaron muchas cosas,\npero no es momento de\nhablar de eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "I'm really sorry, Takuya!　",
      "speaker_id": 7041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14087,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Lo siento mucho, Takuya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Anyway, our first priority is to\ntake care of this.",
      "speaker_id": 7051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14115,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Bueno, lo primero es\nocuparnos de esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Let's do it, guys!",
      "speaker_id": 7061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14167,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Vamos, chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I guess we're not gonna be able to\nget in that easily!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14186,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡Parece que no será fácil\nentrar ahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Why don't we all try to break in\nat once?",
      "speaker_id": 7041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14241,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¿Por qué no entramos todos\na la vez?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Well, we shouldn't all be wearing\nourselves out...",
      "speaker_id": 7051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14283,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Bueno, no deberíamos\nagotarnos todos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Why don't we split up into pairs,\nthen?",
      "speaker_id": 7021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14334,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¿Y si nos dividimos en\nparejas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "But if we split up into teams,\nwe're not gonna make it in time.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14374,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "Pero si nos dividimos,\nno llegaremos a tiempo."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Why don't you go ahead then,\nTai?",
      "speaker_id": 7011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14438,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¿Por qué no vas tú\nprimero, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Daisuke...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14475,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "Daisuke..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You're the leader here, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14486,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Tú eres el líder, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Takuya...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14518,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Takuya..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Tai, let's pick who we want to\ngo with us!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14528,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Tai, ¡elige quién quieres\nque venga contigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Hurry, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14574,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Rápido, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Guys! We're gonna protect the\nDigital World and our own worlds,\nwith our own hands!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14589,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "¡Chicos! ¡Vamos a proteger\nel Digimundo y nuestros\nmundos con nuestras manos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14673,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14679,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "That's the spatial control core...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14682,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Ese es el núcleo espacial..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "It's coming!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14717,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Ya viene!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14730,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "...WarGreymon?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14734,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "...¡¿WarGreymon?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "It's the very last one!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14750,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Es el último de todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Guys! This is the last one! If we\ndefeat him, we can stop the\nspatial control core!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14774,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "¡Chicos! ¡Es el último! ¡Si lo\nvencemos, detenemos el\nnúcleo de control espacial!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Yeah! Let's go, guys!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14858,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Vamos, chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "...!!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14880,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "...!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We did it! We did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14886,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Ganamos! ¡Ganamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We're out of time! We have to stop\nthe spatial control core!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14908,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¡Se acaba el tiempo! ¡Hay que\ndetener el núcleo espacial!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Hackmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14969,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Hackmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "N-No way! It shouldn't have this\nmuch power!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14978,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡N-No puede ser! ¡No debería\ntener tanto poder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Hackmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15023,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Hackmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Tai! Guys!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15032,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hackmon...!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15046,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Hackmon...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Deliver this message to Gankuumon:\nI successfully guided the Chosen\nChildren here!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15058,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "Decidle a Gankoomon: ¡logré\nguiar hasta aquí a los\nNiños Elegidos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Aaaaaaagh!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15141,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Are you okay, Hackmon?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15152,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Estás bien, Hackmon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Tai... Guys... What happened to\nthe spatial control core?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15175,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Tai... chicos... ¿qué pasó\ncon el núcleo espacial?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It's all good! The fake copies are\nall gone.",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15236,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡Todo bien! Las copias\nfalsas desaparecieron."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Thank goodness...",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15281,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "Menos mal..."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Splendid job, chosen ones. And\nyou, Hackmon...",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15299,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Buen trabajo, elegidos.\nY tú, Hackmon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Yes?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15346,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¿Sí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "So the Digital World is safe now,\nright?",
      "speaker_id": 7011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15351,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Entonces el Digimundo\nestá a salvo, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "We can go home!",
      "speaker_id": 7021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15392,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Podemos volver!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Man, this was one heck of a big\nthing!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15408,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Vaya, esto sí que fue\nuna pasada!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "I was hoping I could wreck some\nmore stuff around here...",
      "speaker_id": 7041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15447,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "Y yo que quería romper\nalgo más por aquí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "All our friends back home must be\nworried about us.",
      "speaker_id": 7051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15505,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Nuestros amigos deben\nestar preocupados por\nnosotros."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Aww, I gotta go back to school...",
      "speaker_id": 7061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15557,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Uy, tengo que volver al cole..."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "As thanks for your work, I will\ngrant you all a reward.",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15591,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "Como agradecimiento, os\ndaré una recompensa."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "What? Really?!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15647,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¿Qué? ¡¿En serio?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I... will be your opponent, as a\nRoyal Knight!",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15662,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Yo... seré vuestro rival,\ncomo Caballero Real!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15709,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Now, come!",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15716,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Venid ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "W-We won... We did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15727,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Ganamos! ¡Lo logramos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Splendid! Is this the true power\nof humans allied with Digimon?",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15750,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "¡Espléndido! ¿Es este el\npoder real de humanos y\nDigimon unidos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "But it looks like we've still got\na lot of training to do.",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15814,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Pero parece que aún nos\nqueda mucho por entrenar."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Indeed!",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15873,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Así es!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "So, can we finally go home?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15881,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Ya podemos irnos a casa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Of course! However...",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15909,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Claro! Sin embargo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Oh, no. What now?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15931,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "Vaya. ¿Ahora qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "The moment you leave this space,\nyou will lose all the memories you\nhave obtained here.",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15949,
      "_bytes": 87,
      "translation": "En cuanto salgáis de aquí,\nolvidaréis todo lo que\nhabéis vivido en este lugar."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "If you were to take any of your\nmemories from this place, which\nexists beyond spacetime...",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16037,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "Si os llevarais algún\nrecuerdo de este lugar, que\nexiste más allá del tiempo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "...It would disturb the order of\nthe digital field.",
      "speaker_id": 7191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16128,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "...alteraría el orden del\ncampo digital."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "It's a shame... we just got to\nknow each other!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16180,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¡Qué pena... si apenas nos\nconocíamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Well, I guess we can't do anything\nabout that...",
      "speaker_id": 7011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16228,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Bueno, supongo que no se\npuede hacer nada..."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "I'm just happy I got to meet\nTai!",
      "speaker_id": 7021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16277,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Solo me alegra haber\nconocido a Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Man, I really wanted to play\nsoccer with him...",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16314,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "Vaya, quería jugar al\nfútbol con él..."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Some lost memories won't get in\nthe way of a friendship between\nmen!",
      "speaker_id": 7041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16362,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Unos recuerdos perdidos no\narruinan la amistad entre\nhombres!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I get the feeling we'll meet\nagain, anyway.",
      "speaker_id": 7051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16431,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Presiento que nos\nveremos de nuevo."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I don't really get any kind of\n\"bye!\" feeling from this.",
      "speaker_id": 7061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16475,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "No siento que esto sea\nun \"adiós\" de verdad."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Yeah, that's right! We'll meet\nagain, someday!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16532,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Sí, eso es! ¡Nos veremos\nde nuevo algún día!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Let's meet again someday!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16579,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Nos vemos algún día!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Come with me, Daisuke!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16605,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Ven conmigo, Daisuke!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Choose someone else",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16628,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Elegir a otro"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Come with me, Takato!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16648,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Ven conmigo, Takato!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Choose someone else",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16670,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Elegir a otro"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Come with me, Takuya!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16690,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Ven conmigo, Takuya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Choose someone else",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16712,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Elegir a otro"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Come with me, Masaru!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16732,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Ven conmigo, Masaru!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Choose someone else",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16754,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Elegir a otro"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
